  "description": "Four MCPs turn Claude from a chatbot into something that actually does the work: Perplexity for real time deep research, Firecrawl to search and scrape any website, Playwright to control your browser and fill out forms, and Context7 to keep documentation current for every tool you have connected. The free guide below has one copy paste prompt that installs and verifies all four, plus a manual fallback.\n\nGet the full guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MKXqHzTEXBUavsbLYoXINoixtm6jqKbco2DRCC2kkaA/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeAI #MCP",
